&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is an AI-native performance advertising company, bringing the power of AI advertising to the open internet. Founded in 2013 by machine learning engineers who had built AI advertising systems inside the world&#39;s largest technology companies, Moloco began from a shared mission: to build that same engine for the open internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Moloco is one company with two businesses, built on the same compound AI system. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/moloco-ads&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is our AI-native performance advertising platform, helping mobile app marketers acquire, retain, and re-engage high-value users across the open internet. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/moloco-commerce-media&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Commerce Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is our AI-native retail media platform, enabling retailers and marketplaces to turn their platforms into thriving ad businesses. Both are powered by&lt;strong&gt; CARA (Compound Ad Recommendation Architecture)&lt;/strong&gt;, the AI system behind every Moloco product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moloco, we bring together those who&#39;ve already solved hard problems and those with the drive to. Here, we work on some of the complex problems in AI advertising, at a scale and level of sophistication very few companies can offer. &lt;strong&gt;Come build what&#39;s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;채용 관심 등록 / Expression of Interest:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re always looking to connect with exceptional Software Engineers interested in joining Moloco&#39;s R&amp;amp;D team in Seoul. This posting allows you to share your profile for future opportunities, even if there isn&#39;t a currently open role aligned with your experience. Whether you specialize in backend systems, frontend development, or full-stack engineering, we encourage you to submit your resume — we&#39;d love to stay in touch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco 서울 R&amp;amp;D 팀에 합류하고 싶은 뛰어난 소프트웨어 엔지니어를 항상 찾고 있습니다. 현재 공개된 포지션이 없더라도, 이 등록 페이지를 통해 먼저 이력서를 제출해 주시면 향후 적합한 기회가 생겼을 때 연락드리겠습니다. 백엔드 시스템, 프론트엔드 개발, 혹은 풀스택 엔지니어링 등 전문 분야와 무관하게 지원을 환영합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–15 years of software development experience across backend, frontend, or full-stack systems, with a track record of leading complex, large-scale projects as seniority grows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree or above in Computer Science or equivalent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills with solid fundamentals in data structures and algorithms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and implementing scalable systems — whether server-side APIs and infrastructure, or user-facing web and mobile interfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large-scale distributed systems, high-throughput data pipelines, or performance-critical frontend applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with public cloud platforms such as GCP, AWS, or Azure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency working with AI coding tools as a force multiplier — you plan before prompting, provide architectural context, review generated code critically, and know when to write code yourself versus when AI adds genuine value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in both Korean and English (spoken and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend: Go, Java, Python · GCP / AWS · Kubernetes · BigQuery · Dataflow / Apache Beam · Kafka · gRPC / REST APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend: TypeScript / JavaScript · React · Web performance optimization · Mobile web&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You Work:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your ethos is ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity and enjoy partnering with others to shape vague requirements into clear roadmaps with pragmatic tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take shared accountability for the end-to-end journey; communicating progress, surfacing risks early, and following through to ensure your work creates measurable value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate strong judgment under uncertainty.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prioritize based on long-term impact, over short-term noise, making deliberate decisions when information is incomplete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You explicitly weigh tradeoffs like speed vs. quality and remain agile enough to adjust your approach thoughtfully as new information/data emerges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You lead through clarity and active listening.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You reduce ambiguity for the team by asking the right questions upfront, tailor your communication to your audience, document your decisions, and bring helpful structure to complex discussions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You provide thoughtful, evidence-based feedback when needed and align behind decisions once they are made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You collaborate early, instead of solving in isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build trust across the organization by listening first and navigate conflicting needs with empathy, creating buy-in around priorities and scope.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You navigate technical tensions productively, disagreeing thoughtfully while maintaining momentum and strengthening professional relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You fall in love with the problem, not the solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You build for the long run, looking beyond immediate tasks to understand root causes, second-order effects, and the long-term health of our ML ecosystem.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;When something breaks, you don’t just patch it; you seek structural improvements that prevent recurrence and elevate the technical bar for the entire organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prioritize customer impact and take action to make it real.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You prioritize effective solutions that drive business impact over technical elegance, spotting opportunities that others might overlook.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the initiative to turn ideas into outcomes and the agency to identify and fix gaps, even when they aren’t yet on the formal roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-10b2a5c2-7fff-9123-b3ca-404b4268f3fb&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting Your Best Work and Your Best Life:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits are designed to support our people in doing their best work and living well, at work and beyond. Benefits vary by country, employment type, and eligibility. Connect with a recruiter to learn more about benefits in your region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Humility:&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone’s voice is respected, valued, and heard. We win, lose, and learn together. Accountability and feedback are essential to our success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncapped Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; We see all situations as opportunities to learn, grow, and improve as individuals and as an organization. We seek diverse perspectives, encourage curiosity, and promote experimentation to push the boundaries of what’s possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Real Value: &lt;/strong&gt;We pursue the most impactful opportunities with intensity and rigor. We take intelligent risks and make disciplined trade-offs to maintain deep focus. We help our customers win by delivering durable value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go Further Together: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re one team working towards one vision. We collaborate proactively and inclusively, involving the right people at the right time and in the right way. We strive to create a more equitable workplace. We won’t let each other fail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Resources:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/blogs&quot;&gt;Moloco Company Blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/company/leadership&quot;&gt;Moloco Leadership&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/newsroom&quot;&gt;Moloco Newsroom&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Use in Interviews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process is designed to get to know the real you. Unless a round specifically includes AI as part of what&#39;s being assessed, we ask that candidates engage without AI assistance. Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.cloud/hubfs/careers/AI%20Use%20in%20Interviews.pdf&quot;&gt;AI Use in Interviews Policy&lt;/a&gt; before your interview to understand what to expect. Failure to comply with this policy may impact your candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your privacy matters to us. By applying, you acknowledge that you’ve reviewed our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.cloud/hubfs/careers/Candidate%20Privacy%20Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is an AI-native performance advertising company, bringing the power of AI advertising to the open internet. Founded in 2013 by machine learning engineers who had built AI advertising systems inside the world&#39;s largest technology companies, Moloco began from a shared mission: to build that same engine for the open internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Moloco is one company with two businesses, built on the same compound AI system. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/moloco-ads&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is our AI-native performance advertising platform, helping mobile app marketers acquire, retain, and re-engage high-value users across the open internet. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/moloco-commerce-media&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Commerce Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is our AI-native retail media platform, enabling retailers and marketplaces to turn their platforms into thriving ad businesses. Both are powered by&lt;strong&gt; CARA (Compound Ad Recommendation Architecture)&lt;/strong&gt;, the AI system behind every Moloco product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moloco, we bring together those who&#39;ve already solved hard problems and those with the drive to. Here, we work on some of the complex problems in AI advertising, at a scale and level of sophistication very few companies can offer. &lt;strong&gt;Come build what&#39;s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You’ll Be Contributing to Moloco:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Growth Manager on Moloco Commerce Media&#39;s Advertiser &amp;amp; Agency team, you&#39;ll drive Commerce Media adoption among the market&#39;s most important advertisers and agencies. This is a hands-on role where account growth meets business development, at a senior level: you&#39;ll own the most strategic and complex advertiser/agency relationships, lead high-stakes negotiations independently, and be trusted to make judgment calls with minimal oversight.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll combine selective new-business development with deep expansion of existing advertiser and agency relationships, working closely with platform-side Growth, Product, Data, and Legal to grow Commerce Media&#39;s footprint.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pipeline &amp;amp; New Opportunity Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and engage the most strategic potential advertisers and agencies, introducing Commerce Media capabilities and driving platform adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently build and manage a pipeline of growth opportunities (both new accounts and expansion within existing advertiser/agency relationships) from opportunity identification through to close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and size target segments within the advertiser and agency landscape, shaping the go-to-market approach for the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead negotiation of commercial terms and manage contracting for complex, higher-value deals, in close collaboration with Legal and Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Growth &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a portfolio of the most strategic advertiser and agency relationships, building trusted, senior-level relationships with key stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify expansion opportunities and develop tailored strategies for growing each account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own end-to-end campaign execution for advertisers and agencies, including onboarding, campaign setup, performance monitoring, and optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze account and campaign data to generate insights, identify upsell/cross-sell opportunities, and advise advertisers and agencies on optimizing ad spend and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration &amp;amp; Team Contribution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with platform-side Growth Managers to align advertiser demand with commerce platform supply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the voice of advertisers and agencies internally, feeding market and client insights into product and go-to-market strategy discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and share playbooks, sales narratives, and best practices that improve team efficiency and support scalable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Do I Know if the Role is Right For Me?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-7+ years of experience in ad tech, e-commerce, or media sales/business development, with a strong track record of developing new business and growing complex, high-value accounts independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead and close complex, multi-stakeholder negotiations with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial instincts, with the ability to identify, structure, and close new opportunities in ambiguous situations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and relationship-building skills, with a track record of building trust at senior/executive levels with agency and advertiser stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical mindset; comfortable working with data, drawing insights, and translating numbers into clear strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High ownership mentality, entrepreneurial drive, and comfort operating in a fast-moving, global company environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required; proficiency in additional languages relevant to the local market is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-10b2a5c2-7fff-9123-b3ca-404b4268f3fb&quot;&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Supporting Your Best Work and Your Best Life:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits are designed to support our people in doing their best work and living well, at work and beyond. Benefits vary by country, employment type, and eligibility. Connect with a recruiter to learn more about benefits in your region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead with Humility:&lt;/strong&gt; Everyone’s voice is respected, valued, and heard. We win, lose, and learn together. Accountability and feedback are essential to our success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Uncapped Growth Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; We see all situations as opportunities to learn, grow, and improve as individuals and as an organization. We seek diverse perspectives, encourage curiosity, and promote experimentation to push the boundaries of what’s possible.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create Real Value: &lt;/strong&gt;We pursue the most impactful opportunities with intensity and rigor. We take intelligent risks and make disciplined trade-offs to maintain deep focus. We help our customers win by delivering durable value.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go Further Together: &lt;/strong&gt;We’re one team working towards one vision. We collaborate proactively and inclusively, involving the right people at the right time and in the right way. We strive to create a more equitable workplace. We won’t let each other fail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Resources:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/blogs&quot;&gt;Moloco Company Blog&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/company/leadership&quot;&gt;Moloco Leadership&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/newsroom&quot;&gt;Moloco Newsroom&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Use in Interviews&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our interview process is designed to get to know the real you. Unless a round specifically includes AI as part of what&#39;s being assessed, we ask that candidates engage without AI assistance. Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.cloud/hubfs/careers/AI%20Use%20in%20Interviews.pdf&quot;&gt;AI Use in Interviews Policy&lt;/a&gt; before your interview to understand what to expect. Failure to comply with this policy may impact your candidacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your privacy matters to us. By applying, you acknowledge that you’ve reviewed our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.cloud/hubfs/careers/Candidate%20Privacy%20Notice.pdf&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco is an AI-native performance advertising company, bringing the power of AI advertising to the open internet. Founded in 2013 by machine learning engineers who had built AI advertising systems inside the world&#39;s largest technology companies, Moloco began from a shared mission: to build that same engine for the open internet.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, Moloco is one company with two businesses, built on the same compound AI system. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/moloco-ads&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Ads&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is our AI-native performance advertising platform, helping mobile app marketers acquire, retain, and re-engage high-value users across the open internet. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.moloco.com/moloco-commerce-media&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Moloco Commerce Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is our AI-native retail media platform, enabling retailers and marketplaces to turn their platforms into thriving ad businesses. Both are powered by&lt;strong&gt; CARA (Compound Ad Recommendation Architecture)&lt;/strong&gt;, the AI system behind every Moloco product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Moloco, we bring together those who&#39;ve already solved hard problems and those with the drive to. Here, we work on some of the complex problems in AI advertising, at a scale and level of sophistication very few companies can offer. &lt;strong&gt;Come build what&#39;s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Impact You’ll Be Contributing to Moloco:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP of Business Development, MCM, the Head of Strategic Growth, APAC will lead Moloco&#39;s Strategic Growth team across the region. While supporting retailers and marketplaces throughout APAC, the team is primarily based in Seoul and partners closely with regional Sales, Product, and Engineering leaders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for helping Moloco Commerce Media customers build, launch, and scale successful commerce media businesses. Acting as a trusted strategic advisor to senior customer executives, the team helps define commerce media strategy, operating models, advertiser growth initiatives, and long-term business success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beyond customer engagement, this leader will play a key role in shaping Moloco&#39;s MCM business in APAC by bringing together customer insights, market trends, and commercial priorities to influence product strategy, regional investments, and go-to-market execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Lead and develop the APAC Strategic Growth team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach, and develop a team of Strategic Growth Managers and Directors across APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear priorities, operating rhythms, and standards for strategic customer engagement and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of high ownership, intellectual rigor, collaboration, and continuous development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the team in navigating complex customer situations, executive relationships, and strategic decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive customer growth and business outcomes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable retailers and marketplaces to build scalable commerce media businesses while accelerating advertising revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with customer executives to define commerce media strategies, business plans, operating models, and go-to-market priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers identify and execute the highest-impact growth levers across both advertiser demand and supply.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic engagements, executive meetings, and business reviews for Moloco&#39;s most important APAC partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Build trusted, long-term customer partnerships&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop enduring relationships with senior stakeholders across business and technology organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Moloco and the Strategic Growth team as trusted advisors on commerce media strategy and business growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of each customer&#39;s business model, market dynamics, organizational priorities, and growth strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate customer needs, identify partnership risks early, and mobilize the right Moloco resources to address them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Shape the APAC MCM business&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with cross-functional leaders across Moloco to deliver a cohesive customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the voice of APAC customers, identifying recurring needs and influencing product and go-to-market priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor market developments, competitive dynamics, and customer trends to identify strategic opportunities and risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable operating models and best practices that can be applied across APAC and Moloco&#39;s global MCM business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;cubbob&quot; data-start=&quot;3394&quot; data-end=&quot;3414&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;cubbob&quot; data-start=&quot;3394&quot; data-end=&quot;3414&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of relevant experience, including experience leading high-performing customer-facing teams and delivering measurable commercial or operational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience spanning strategy consulting, ad tech, retail, commerce media, or enterprise technology businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with experience developing business strategies, go-to-market plans, and revenue growth initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success advising executive stakeholders and building trusted relationships with large, complex enterprise customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of digital advertising, performance advertising, retail media, or marketplace monetization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical rigor, with the ability to translate complex analysis into clear business decisions, executive recommendations, and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence and collaborate effectively across Product, Engineering, Sales, and other cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with ML- and AI-enabled products and communicating their value to business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-growing global environment, creating structure while navigating ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in Seoul, with fluency in both Korean and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
