&lt;p&gt;At Moloco, we bring together those who&#39;ve already solved hard problems and those with the drive to. Here, we work on some of the complex problems in AI advertising, at a scale and level of sophistication very few companies can offer. &lt;strong&gt;Come build what&#39;s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Impact You&#39;ll Be Contributing to Moloco&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moloco helps businesses grow through machine learning-powered advertising and measurement. As a TPM supporting our CTV business, you will help shape how CTV products and platforms scale across app, web, and smart TV environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will make an impact by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connecting business goals to clear priorities, milestones, and execution plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating visibility into performance, investment, operational health, and progress against goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aligning Product, Engineering, Data, Finance, and Go-to-Market teams around shared outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating identity, measurement, reporting, and platform initiatives that improve the CTV experience for customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Helping global teams move with greater clarity and predictability across Seoul and other Moloco offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the TPM for CTV, you will lead complex, cross-functional programs from problem definition through launch and post-launch learning. You will partner with Product, Engineering, Infrastructure, Data Science and Machine Learning, Finance, Strategy, Go-to-Market, and customer-facing teams across Moloco.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate CTV strategy and customer needs into a focused roadmap, well-defined workstreams, milestones, and dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear planning and communication rhythms that keep teams aligned and leaders informed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive execution across technical and business initiatives, bringing structure to ambiguity and momentum to high-priority work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks, surface trade-offs, and guide decisions to resolution through influence and strong stakeholder partnership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect launch plans with measurable outcomes, using data and feedback to improve products and operating practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build effective collaboration across Seoul and Moloco’s global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;How Do I Know if the Role is Right For Me?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role may be a strong fit if you enjoy turning complex problems into coordinated action and helping teams deliver meaningful outcomes together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What you bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex, cross-functional technical programs involving Product, Engineering, Data or Machine Learning, Infrastructure, Finance, and/or Go-to-Market teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong program-management fundamentals, including problem definition, scoping, planning, milestone and dependency management, risk mitigation, and concise progress communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical depth to understand system architecture, technical design documents, system components, and data flows, and to engage productively with technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort planning and communicating in environments where outcomes, priorities, or technical approaches evolve over time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The judgment and influence to bring clarity to ambiguity, make trade-offs visible, and move decisions forward without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English communication for collaboration with colleagues and leaders across global offices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage multiple workstreams while balancing strategic planning with hands-on execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of technical program management or engineering management experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience working directly with software, cloud, or data engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in computer science, engineering, or a related technical discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience that will help you thrive&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background as a TPM, Technical Program Manager, Engineering Program Manager, Product Manager, engineer, or in a comparable technical leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in AdTech, advertising platforms, DSP or SSP, measurement, identity, CTV/OTT, streaming, commerce, or large-scale data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience connecting business outcomes such as revenue, cost, customer activation, quality, or reliability to technical execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working across US and APAC teams or in a globally distributed organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome candidates from a range of technical domains. Experience with CTV or advertising is valuable, and strong program leadership, technical judgment, and the ability to learn a new domain quickly are equally important.&lt;/p&gt;
